es in the target video, whose appearance comes from <Picture 2>, replacing the original black heels in <Video 1> while the showcasing function, camera, and actions are preserved.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second vertical 9:16 product showcase in which <Subject 1>, a woman whose appearance comes from <Picture 1>, presents <Subject 2>, color-block high-heel sandals whose appearance comes from <Picture 2>, following the shot order, camera, and action timing of <Video 1>. <Subject 1> (S1) delivers a four-line Chinese sales pitch, and her lip and jaw movements synchronize syllable-by-syllable with the driving audio (drive_audio).\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], speaker S1): fully_preserved - the presenter's motions, poses, and framing from <Video 1> are retained while her appearance is drawn from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): attribute_transfer - the color-block high-heel sandal appearance from <Picture 2> replaces the original black heels while the showcasing function and actions are preserved.\n<Video 1> (shot order, camera, pacing, and actions): fully_preserved - the cut structure, camera moves, and action timing of the reference video are retained, aligned to the four narration segments.\ndriving audio (drive_audio): reference - <Subject 1>'s (S1) lip and jaw movements follow the driving audio syllable-by-syllable; no separate audio label is introduced.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a bright, warm live-commerce product showcase in vertical 9:16, set in a cozy indoor space with a wooden cabinet and warm LED strip lighting, shelves of decor, and greenery, using realistic soft lighting and gentle, mostly static camera work.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames <Subject 1>, the woman from <Picture 1> in the deep-blue patterned qipao with a stand collar, green frog buttons, an updo hairpiece, and light-green jade drop earrings, facing the camera in the warm set. She lifts <Subject 2>, the glossy color-block high-heel sandals from <Picture 2> with royal-blue and rose-pink panels, gold straps, a gem-set metal buckle at the toe, and a thick heel, holding one shoe in each hand and presenting them toward the lens with a warm smile. <Subject 1> (S1) opens her mouth and speaks, her lip and jaw movements synchronizing syllable-by-syllable with the driving audio (drive_audio): she calls out with an enthusiastic first syllable, opening her mouth wide, then pressing her lips together on the final bilabial consonant as the jaw rises slightly, saying <d>[Chinese] 姐妹们看过来！这双真皮高跟鞋，质感真的绝了。</d> The camera holds with a subtle push-in.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of <Subject 2>, the color-block high-heel sandal from <Picture 2>, held in <Subject 1>'s hand. A manicured finger traces the gem-set metal buckle and the gold strap; the glossy royal-blue and rose-pink panels catch the warm light with a soft sheen, while the background falls into warm bokeh. <Subject 1> (S1), speaking off-screen in sync with the driving audio (drive_audio), keeps her lips soft and measured, opening them for open vowels and closing them on the syllable-initial stops, her jaw moving in small steady cycles, as she says <d>[Chinese] 大家看这个皮面，细腻有光泽，缝线也非常工整；鞋垫软软的，久穿不累脚。</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to a low angle on <Subject 1>'s legs and feet wearing <Subject 2>, the color-block high-heel sandals, as she walks across the wooden floor, one foot lifting in a mid-step and the other landing firmly on the thick heel; she then crouches briefly to smooth the gold strap at her ankle. <Subject 1> (S1) speaks in sync with the driving audio (drive_audio): her lips spread and narrow on the high vowels, opening wider on the emphatic syllables, her jaw dropping with each stressed syllable, saying <d>[Chinese] 上脚超显腿长！而且你们看，皮质非常柔软，走路一点都不磨脚。</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:12.000, the shot cuts back to a medium shot of <Subject 1> standing in <Subject 2> with a small lavalier microphone, facing the camera and delivering the closing pitch. Her lip and jaw movements synchronize syllable-by-syllable with the driving audio (drive_audio): her lips round on the rounded vowels, open wide on the open exclamatory syllables, and press together on the bilabial consonants, her jaw dropping and closing in rhythm with the speech before she closes into a smile. She gestures, raising one index finger toward the upper part of the frame. A red flash-sale callout reading \"限时秒杀\" with a shopping-cart icon appears at the bottom-left and holds to the end of the 15 seconds, as she says <d>[Chinese] 现在下单限时秒杀，左下角购物车，手慢无哦，姐妹们！</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft indoor room tone and the subtle sounds of the presenter's gestures, the shoe resting in her hand, and the thick heels tapping the wooden floor continue throughout the video, with the driving audio (drive_audio) carrying the spoken pitch.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A - no distinct audience-only score is specified; the audible soundtrack is carried by the driving audio (drive_audio) to which the presenter's lip and jaw movements synchronize.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [298.8001708984375, 539.8999633789062], "pos": [1867.3389892578125, 950.7736206054688], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#3f5159", "groupcolor": "#3f789e", "color": "#2a363b"}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "文件名", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "minimax", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 19, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden":